name=Nutrition Revamp
id=NutritionRevamp
description=Realism nutrition overhaul for Build 42 servers. Tracks nutrients beyond the four vanilla macros, re-bases 522 vanilla foods from published food-composition data, and drives hunger, thirst, body weight, strength and deficiency and excess effects from a two-compartment body model, shown in a panel, a tooltip band, a character tab and optional moodles. Set the vanilla Nutrition sandbox option off. Incompatible: Nutrition Makes Sense; hunger, energy or weight model mods; fatigue writers; body-weight and metabolism mods; SomewhatTraitsCore's adaptive-metabolism trait. Followed as rate tunings: Nutrition Tweaker Enhanced, endurance and ZomboidGlobals tweaks; a direct stat write is read as an outside change; awake endurance stays vanilla's. Redundant: ApocalipseBR Nutrition Sync Fix (disable its sync module). MoodleFramework is optional. Every update that changes a script file is a server event: update the server first. See README, CHANGELOG and COMPATIBILITY in the mod folder.
modversion=1.0.0
versionMin=42.20.4
